# Close-ups of the market props whose parts were inside out (back-face check, 2026-10-21).
# Copies from the market census; outdoor props from four sides, the carpet at its four edges.
# Run with the set root and with a root of the earlier bake; OPENGOTHIC_CENSUS=<absolute out>/census.json.
# A shot is written at the end of its frame: wait after it before the camera moves on.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
ui off
view nopfx
cam lift off
